Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.52,0:00:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream, one wish If you want it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.04,0:00:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,gotta go over the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Setting sail and heading for the unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Cutting through the\Nwinds and waves as I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep it up, never stopping, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.52,0:00:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause I'm aiming to get there first, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.96,0:00:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all or nothing. No time to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.50,0:00:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it later, right now I'm living free.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.48,0:00:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,When your foes look like\Nthey will overwhelm you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.52,0:00:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It means your heart's saying\Nthis is what you can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.30,0:00:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite all that to run is not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.64,0:01:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Once they're closed, I\Nfeel the satisfaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.72,0:01:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm rude,\Nhere's my appreciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.02,0:01:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,When things are getting\Ntough, just gotta smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.86,0:01:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are going on your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.40,0:01:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're looking for\Na fresh, brand new day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.66,0:01:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Then make sure your only\Nthought you have is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.82,0:01:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.34,0:01:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,As you're on your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.16,0:01:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Marks maps will be made.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.44,0:01:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, with every step that you will take.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.28,0:01:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at all you've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.48,0:01:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Look ahead at new horizons.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.22,0:01:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,In view shining brightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.06,0:01:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, who knows what's waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.86,0:01:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Dream living, that's the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.22,0:01:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Make like a hurricane.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.26,0:01:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, got to make your mark today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.10,0:01:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream, one wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.06,0:01:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dreams don't run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.08,0:01:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for the knockout.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.60,0:02:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone, quiet down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.04,0:02:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Class is about to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.46,0:02:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, we'll go over the\Nland of Buono's history.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.16,0:02:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma 'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.50,0:02:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,First question.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.30,0:02:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What is Sakoku?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.92,0:02:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.38,0:02:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.78,0:02:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It means cozy and country stores in\Norder to protect the peace! Very good!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.24,0:02:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy Pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.20,0:02:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, what is Kaikoku? Anyone know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.98,0:02:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.60,0:02:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.51,0:02:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You up front!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.43,0:02:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma 'am, it's when evil outsiders\Nwith bad ideas are let in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.94,0:02:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's unhealthy for one's nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.64,0:02:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's how foreign countries want to take\Nadvantage of what the land of Wano has.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.52,0:02:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,for example.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.76,0:02:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's correct!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.02,0:02:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Nicely done!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.98,0:02:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Moving on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.56,0:03:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's talk about some of the fools who\Ntolerated such a thing in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.58,0:03:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Naughty children, you have to\Nraise your hands to be called on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.56,0:03:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Wiggle, wiggle, wiggle, wiggle!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.44,0:03:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.35,0:03:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,She made her guest pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.92,0:03:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Wiggling out like that is\Nquite unbecoming, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.98,0:03:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh come on, we knew the answer now, now you\Nmight as well have just said a bad word.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.14,0:03:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Mention of the Akazaya 9\Nis forbidden in my class;
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.38,0:03:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,those words have been\Ntainted for two decades.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.28,0:03:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's the hero who defeated\Nthose mean samurai?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.00,0:03:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you may all answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.08,0:03:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the Shogun Kurozumi Orochi! Bravo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.08,0:03:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Orochi two-sword style!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.34,0:03:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I will strike you all down, evil samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.58,0:04:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.66,0:04:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Those children are being\Ntaught blatant lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.54,0:04:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What a terrible education.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.98,0:04:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Shogun Orochi is like a hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.34,0:04:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He saved the land of Line from bad guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.92,0:04:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.83,0:04:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And not only that, he ended\Nall those awful people's lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.80,0:04:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We have him to thank for\Nour beautiful country.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.64,0:04:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't be nearly as\Npeaceful if it weren't for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.04,0:04:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Shogun Orochi is truly a gutless wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.86,0:04:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Kirushiro, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.22,0:04:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you gone mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.84,0:04:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't say that so loudly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.76,0:04:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.88,0:04:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.22,0:04:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're shaking, but it's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.14,0:04:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What does it matter if\Nsomeone happens to hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.10,0:05:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Liquor?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.01,0:05:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I require more liquor!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.32,0:05:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he have connections with Orochi?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.96,0:05:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The snapping Kiyoshiro fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.92,0:05:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I can collect\Nsome information from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.70,0:05:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It was 20 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.68,0:05:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Standing before his burning castle,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.02,0:05:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Odin's wife uttered one final message\Nbefore taking her last breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.80,0:05:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the moon unaware of the dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.90,0:05:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,May your purpose be fulfilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.36,0:05:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And cast nine shadows on the\Nnight woven of twenty years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.90,0:06:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and you shall know the\Nbrilliance of the dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.92,0:06:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know how Shogun\NOrochi interpreted this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.30,0:06:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a real hoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.22,0:06:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Please do continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.40,0:06:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Shogun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.82,0:06:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.02,0:06:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't leave me hanging, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.38,0:06:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.22,0:06:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Where were we?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.18,0:06:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Carry this curse with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.76,0:06:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.46,0:07:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Upon a moonlit night, this grudge\Nshall be settled in a score.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.48,0:07:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Nine spiteful samurai\Nspecters will emerge to
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.16,0:07:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,slay you in cold blood and\Nfulfill their vengeance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.82,0:07:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They shall end your reign\Nand reopen the land of Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.94,0:07:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This marks that very\Nyear, wouldn't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.88,0:07:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the reason why Shogun Orochi\Nis frightened out of his wits!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.64,0:07:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't rest knowing\Nthe ghosts of the Kozuki
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.30,0:07:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,clan could come and kill\Nhim at any given moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.30,0:07:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,How I'd love to see that one play out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.72,0:07:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What can the dead do anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.56,0:07:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He's shown them before that\Nhe's not to be reckoned with.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.44,0:07:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,How many times must they\Nbe taught this same lesson?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.56,0:08:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Those fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.84,0:08:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he need to cook\Nthem alive a second time?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.68,0:08:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Odin Castle was not in such a\Nsorry state when this tale begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.36,0:08:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, you should know, its\Ntrue name is Kuri Castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.38,0:08:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The love for Lord Odin ran deep, so\Nthey honored his home with that moniker.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.40,0:08:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Momo's dad, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.04,0:08:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.24,0:08:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Odin was a boisterous fellow,\Ndaring in every respect of the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.66,0:08:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,His father was the Shogun\Nof Wano at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.82,0:08:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet despite being Lord\NTsukiyaki's own flesh and blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.38,0:08:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,he was more known for his free\Nspirit and unconventional ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.32,0:09:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,With his non-conformist lifestyle\Nand repeated acts of violence,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.68,0:09:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,it eventually earned him\Nbanishment from the Flower Capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.36,0:09:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.27,0:09:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.60,0:09:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So Lord Odin ventured out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.42,0:09:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He'd outgrown his home,\Ncalling it tiresome.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.62,0:09:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.70,0:09:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll see you there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.74,0:09:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Before long, his journey led him\Nto the lawless area of our country.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.52,0:09:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a place where criminals and exiled\NRonan from various regions ran rampant.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.72,0:09:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,As one can imagine, it was full\Nof theft, violence, and bloodshed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.66,0:09:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This hell was so far beyond saving that\Neven the Shogun's family turned away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.58,0:09:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Its name was Kuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.96,0:09:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I could get used to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.78,0:09:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It was like fate itself brought him there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.40,0:10:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That day, Lord Odin strode\Ninto his soon-to-be home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.66,0:10:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon after, Kuri's most\Nwicked man appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.32,0:10:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He had his band of thugs\Nand was looking for trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.46,0:10:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ashura Doji was his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.70,0:10:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,They clashed immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.46,0:11:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,With one artful strike, Lord\NOdin brought down his foe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.26,0:11:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Remarkably, with his victory, also\Ncame the loyalty of Doji's underlings.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.60,0:11:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, he was something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.72,0:11:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Swooped in like a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.48,0:11:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a remarkable fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.38,0:11:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,His actions even helped\NKuri in its formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.24,0:11:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Major changes followed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.14,0:11:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He taught and gave the\Nruffians work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.66,0:11:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Buildings began to pop up. And\Nthe castle too. Then ultimately,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.72,0:11:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,the Paradise Farm was\Nlaunched for the citizens
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.10,0:11:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This once wasteland\NTransformed into a vibrant
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.50,0:11:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,region full of laughter\Nand prosperity At last,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.22,0:11:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Odin was bestowed the well-earned\Ntitle of Daimyo. By the Shogun Sukiyaki
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.62,0:12:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Incredible to think how much this man\Naccomplished by the mere age of 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.52,0:12:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,he dug out a river built docks connected
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.58,0:12:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,with neighboring regions\Nand other people too
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.44,0:12:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,you know what i mean
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.14,0:12:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,i must admit i agree completely
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.70,0:12:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He was clearly adored by\Nall his people. However,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.38,0:12:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,that Summit was still a maverick by nature
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.22,0:12:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And for someone with his personality,\Nhaving so many vassals didn't suit his style
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.28,0:12:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a particular\Nphrase he often said
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.12,0:13:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I say, it's a bit stuffy around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.40,0:13:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,For Lord Odin, the land of\NWano was a bit too small.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.86,0:13:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Those were the days.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.28,0:13:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.76,0:13:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The very beach we washed\Nashore on all those years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.68,0:13:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Afraid of the unfamiliar, the locals\Ndubbed us talking dog and talking cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.60,0:13:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But Lord Odin treated us differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.56,0:13:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What did they do to deserve abuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.94,0:13:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Fearing those different than\Nyou exposes your ignorance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.40,0:14:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He was our savior.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.84,0:14:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Adored by all, highly esteemed in his\Nland, he charmed Roger and Whitebeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.16,0:14:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That man was a true hero, and\Nour master, a beloved treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.60,0:14:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Funny, vibrant, merry, good-natured, he\Nwas the reason why Kuri was thriving.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.82,0:14:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a tragic day in Wano's history.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.76,0:14:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So what happened to Odin next?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.26,0:14:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Tried as a criminal in\Nfront of his people.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.08,0:15:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He was executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.38,0:15:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's messed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.06,0:15:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard ought to cheat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.76,0:15:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's cheating!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.24,0:15:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What a coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.22,0:15:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,After all that he'd done?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.42,0:15:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,How sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.26,0:15:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It was indeed untimely and unfair.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.10,0:15:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,These events may have transpired\Ntwo decades ago, but for
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.70,0:15:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,us it was only a few months
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.18,0:15:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,a wound so fresh that every
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.40,0:15:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,time I close my eyes the\Nheartbreaking memory of that
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.28,0:15:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,brave warriors final moments\Nvividly echoes within my mind
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.28,0:15:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Korya!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.90,0:15:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What a remarkable man he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.64,0:16:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's amazing that the rest of you\Nguys walked away from that situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.22,0:16:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.13,0:16:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Our choice to make a\Nquick escape was clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.82,0:16:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,With no allies, we were only\Nawaiting our inevitable demise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.30,0:16:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We fled the execution ground and\Nheaded straight here to Odin Castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.40,0:16:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Along the way, Dog Storm and Cat\NViper were caught by Orochi's men.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.16,0:16:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Forced to abandon them, we\Nassumed their lives were lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.20,0:16:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter which of us fell, we all\Nunderstood someone had to reach the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.22,0:16:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Orochi's next target was unquestionably\Ngoing to be the young Lord Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.50,0:16:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This would be his final step\Nto dismantle the Kozuki clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.08,0:16:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No, too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.20,0:16:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Pace is ahead of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.60,0:17:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy had already sent Odin Castle ablaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.92,0:17:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn savages.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.72,0:17:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.44,0:17:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This won't stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.04,0:17:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Seize them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.84,0:17:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,How are shuriken?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.10,0:17:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Momonosuke,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.70,0:17:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,his younger sister, Lady Hiyori,\Nand their mother, Lady Kozuki Toki,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.58,0:17:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,were trapped within the burning edifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.02,0:17:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.92,0:17:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear my call?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.28,0:17:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.62,0:17:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.92,0:17:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.50,0:17:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And make taste!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.96,0:18:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.36,0:18:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.90,0:18:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Hiyori!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.56,0:18:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Toki!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.18,0:18:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It is with heavy heart\NI must relay this news.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.06,0:18:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite our greatest\Nefforts, Lord Odin was slain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.66,0:18:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.10,0:18:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You need not bear the blame. Madam!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.84,0:18:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Lift your heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.40,0:18:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.52,0:18:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.92,0:18:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.00,0:18:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I shall remain behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.18,0:18:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Reconsider! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.76,0:18:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not too late to flee, Lady Toki!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.42,0:18:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.54,0:18:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I shall stay too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.50,0:18:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,All of us here will share the same fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.80,0:18:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave to the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.86,0:18:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Live on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.80,0:18:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.20,0:19:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We may lack the power needed\Nto return to the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.86,0:19:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,However, we're able to leap ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.36,0:19:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,By the ability of the strange\Ntime—time fruit I ingested, I
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.56,0:19:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,have been able to travel farther\Nand farther into the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.08,0:19:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,future, and I have finally arrived\Nhere, the place where my journey ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.94,0:19:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It was hard to believe,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.70,0:19:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,but rumor had it that Lady Toki was not\Nborn in our time, but in an era long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.32,0:19:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.23,0:19:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it because you belong with Lord Odin?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.58,0:19:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.04,0:19:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing left to\Ndo, so I shall stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.92,0:19:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish we could take you, but I can\Nsee your mind is already made up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.12,0:20:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise you this, and\Nwe will make good on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.32,0:20:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we arrive in the future, we\Nshall fulfill Lord Odin's dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.52,0:20:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Both Orochi and Kaido will be defeated!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.26,0:20:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And finally, this I swear,\Nwe shall reopen Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.72,0:20:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Please look after my son, Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.96,0:20:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.94,0:20:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My mother, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.60,0:20:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.48,0:20:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not leave you aside!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.98,0:20:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't make me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.36,0:20:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I've made up my mind too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.56,0:20:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother! Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.48,0:20:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I won't leave you here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.88,0:21:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.80,0:21:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.34,0:21:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a dream, or how odd? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.54,0:21:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Toki!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.12,0:21:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Hiyori!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.42,0:21:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.78,0:21:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.02,0:21:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.68,0:21:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do anything rash!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.80,0:21:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.66,0:21:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It bears my name, but why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.90,0:22:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,These graves look weathered, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.88,0:22:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Her power was real.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.58,0:22:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We leapt through time itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.16,0:22:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder, is this Kuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.20,0:22:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what's become of\Nour home in the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.72,0:22:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a world that was\Ntruly unknown to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.28,0:22:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Since we arrived from 20 years\Nprior, we had to adapt quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.54,0:22:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We decided to walk about and\Nexamine the unfamiliar surroundings.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.20,0:22:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking in all that we could,\Nlearning Orochi's impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.52,0:22:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We saw rows of factories and towering
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.36,0:22:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,smokestacks that vented\Nblack filth into our sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.84,0:22:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There was undrinkable water,\Nfood under strict control.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.88,0:22:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Our once verdant region was now\Nbarren, and the very land sucked dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.12,0:23:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The proud Kozuki name was now\Ntainted and uttered with scorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.84,0:23:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a harsh truth to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.26,0:23:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not the land that I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.52,0:23:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not the land that I love.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.50,0:23:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I imagine that no soul would\Nwant to fight alongside us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.54,0:23:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.20,0:23:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,My goodness, it's like a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.50,0:23:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That is Lord Odin's son, is it not?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.50,0:23:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You appear just the same as\Nyou did when we last saw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.88,0:23:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That means Lady Toki's\Nlast words were true.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.04,0:24:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I was once a retainer from Koby.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.26,0:24:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, call me Jibuiman.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.34,0:24:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,For two decades, I have been\Npatiently awaiting your return.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.06,0:24:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I upheld my faith in your\Nmother's final words.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.78,0:24:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What a relief!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.12,0:24:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You knew her?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.06,0:24:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What did she say, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.52,0:24:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me! Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.14,0:24:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,These were her last words.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.08,0:24:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the moon, unaware of\Nthe dawn. May your purpose be.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.74,0:24:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,fulfilled and cast nine shadows\Non the night woven of 20
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.46,0:24:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,years and you shall know the\Nbrilliance of the dawn on
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.66,0:25:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,the day of her death lady toki\Nforewarned the shogun of the
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.82,0:25:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Kozuki clan's eventual revenge,\Nconsidering that none of
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.18,0:25:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Your bodies were ever retrieved,\Nwe kindled the smallest bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.00,0:25:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,of hope that the akazaya nine\Nwould return and that lady
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.58,0:25:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Toki's warning would ring true.\NWe had nothing else to trust in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.52,0:25:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,mother it's unbelievable our undying\Nfaith was rewarded the time is finally
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.22,0:25:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,upon us has promised you return to lead\Nus to victory against the wicked Orochi.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.68,0:25:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Thankfully, we have spent these\Nyears preparing for your return.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.64,0:25:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You will find allies across the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.34,0:25:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.00,0:25:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Look for the people who share this symbol.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.72,0:25:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,On our ankles will be a\Ncrescent moon, just like so.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.92,0:26:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.66,0:26:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We have soldiers then?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.44,0:26:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This many years later?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.46,0:26:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,These allies!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.78,0:26:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How many are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.10,0:26:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We do not have a precise\Nheadcount. However,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.32,0:26:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,there are countless\Npeople across the land of
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.56,0:26:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wano who have been\Nfervently awaiting this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.52,0:26:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll take whatever help we can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.54,0:26:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido's not to be underestimated.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.42,0:26:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He is quite the dangerous man.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.22,0:26:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,One concern we will need\Nto gather all these.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.62,0:26:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,forces in secret somehow if we are caught?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.38,0:26:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear your efforts will\Nhave been in vain indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.86,0:26:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We're at your disposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.48,0:26:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It was astonishing that support\Nalone kept our hope alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.28,0:26:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,knowing that there was still a\Nchance at improving the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.86,0:26:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I entrusted the investigation of our\Nfoes to Kiku, and then myself, Kanjido.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.98,0:26:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Raizo, and Lord Momonosuke\Nwere tasked with the.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.18,0:27:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,journey to gather allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.80,0:27:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Leaving this country is considered\Na heinous crime, so needless to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.72,0:27:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,once we were seen,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.12,0:27:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,we were hounded across the waters,\Nand then we attempted to navigate our
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.86,0:27:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But without the necessary sailing\Nskills, we were shipwrecked.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.66,0:27:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Separated from Raizo, we had\Nno choice but to carry on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.56,0:27:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall reunite with you in ZO!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.08,0:27:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Raizo!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.18,0:27:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Inches from death, we washed\Nup ashore on Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.60,0:27:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Due to his connections with Kaido,\NDoflamingo was hot on our tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.14,0:27:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,In our haste, Lord Momonosuke\Nmistakenly boarded the wrong ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.44,0:27:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.10,0:27:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ultimately, while I was trying to\Nrecover him, I was split up from Kanjido.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.30,0:27:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Spare not a thought for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.12,0:27:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanjido! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.62,0:28:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And just like that, it\Nall escalated so quickly,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.74,0:28:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,we had barely set foot from our home.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.44,0:28:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I had soon found myself on Punk Hazard,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.38,0:28:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,and while seeking Lord\NMomonosuke, I met Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.64,0:28:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Another of Kaido's associates,\Nit was then my now ally, sir Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.22,0:28:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Led me in a most desperate state.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.66,0:28:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I was utterly helpless, but\Nbefore too long, you were there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.28,0:28:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Who goes there?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.76,0:28:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He was talking—I heard him:\N"Your attire is obscene!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.60,0:28:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,All you're wearing is a breast band.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.74,0:28:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You like it, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.54,0:28:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, indeed I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.74,0:29:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You will never make a snack out of me if\Nyou try!" I i I will swallow you whole!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.02,0:29:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Please step away!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.46,0:29:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking back, it's been nothing\Nbut peril and calamity for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.54,0:29:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But we were fortunate to meet you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.52,0:29:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a godsend finding dependable\Npeople like yourselves to join our cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.80,0:29:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortunately for us, we\Nhave one more saving grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.74,0:29:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Our foes underestimate our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.98,0:29:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that they do\Nnot consider us a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.42,0:29:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,To them, they think of\Nus merely as ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.78,0:29:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That reason alone is why we have\Nnot been placed on wanted posters.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.62,0:29:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We re-entered the country, yet they\Nhave not taken notice of our presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.04,0:29:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,As amusing as that is,\Neven I didn't have a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.46,0:29:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiku, I said I was sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.24,0:29:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You two, get a room already!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.94,0:30:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I must remind you,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.76,0:30:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,it is of greatest importance to\Nkeep our presence hidden from Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.84,0:30:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.08,0:30:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I hear ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.54,0:30:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no room for error, seeing as\Nwe are up against Kaido and Orochi.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.84,0:30:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We are fortunate, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.52,0:30:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Our assembly is powerful, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.14,0:30:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats, led by Sir Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.60,0:30:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The Heart Pirates, led by Sir Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.44,0:30:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The Mink Tribe, Dog Storm's\NMusketeers, and Cat Vipers' Guardians.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.22,0:30:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,In addition to rebellious Samurai,\Nwith forces growing by the day,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.80,0:30:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,there's a number we hope to reach, 5,000!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.88,0:30:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,However, we do not wish to\Nengage in a needless war.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.66,0:30:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why it's crucial\Nto gather information
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.24,0:30:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,in secret and construct\Na well-calculated plan
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.44,0:31:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We will seize the enemy\Nleaders. And behead them.
